This document outlines the network security architecture, hardening procedures, and monitoring protocols implemented for ALCRC Corp. The infrastructure leverages a virtualized environment to securely host the company’s internal Web and Database servers. Utilizing OPNsense as the primary perimeter defense, alongside Suricata IDS and strict NAT filtering, the network is designed to isolate critical assets, whitelist authorized personnel, and actively monitor for malicious activity such as SQL Injection attacks
